        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"ec2b8201-2b07-4d4b-b8c3-9d2997ac19cd\",\"review_text\":\"Awesome\"},{\"review_id\":\"fb89973f-bbcc-4bca-899e-6a87869d35f9\",\"review_text\":\"Boycott of Sweden\"},{\"review_id\":\"ec5def18-d442-43b7-b23f-b4715922b579\",\"review_text\":\"No doubt the best music streaming app\"},{\"review_id\":\"9d406b4e-830f-4c97-8f65-b3202403e4bb\",\"review_text\":\"I've been using Spotify for years. For someone who loves all types of music there is no shortage of discovery on Spotify! I have over 3000 songs on my playlists so it does take a while for them to download but once they do I can listen to all my music even without service. Absolutely wonderful for plane rides and road trips. So many different settings so I can curate my music exactly the way I want it. If you're a music, podcast, meditation lover; I strongly recommend you download this app!\"},{\"review_id\":\"14f2ea31-7290-4aa9-861d-bb60bcba652f\",\"review_text\":\"Very disappointed app\"},{\"review_id\":\"56ef5d5c-e3ff-45f9-9959-0e75575f10ee\",\"review_text\":\"music helped me improve my taste 😋\"},{\"review_id\":\"98939944-71c8-4991-aabd-08e364438b26\",\"review_text\":\"It was good making playlist till they made it were you can NOT listen to the song when adding it to the playlist\"},{\"review_id\":\"1c115a68-2c92-488f-bbfb-28c28fa4bd94\",\"review_text\":\"The only problem is that you can't download any song, until you subscribe\"},{\"review_id\":\"a24a9d04-7ef1-4a05-b1c4-6d5c2cac56a5\",\"review_text\":\"I'm tryna update the app and it ain't\"},{\"review_id\":\"fcea382f-6cbf-4f80-afcf-949aee2fa9f7\",\"review_text\":\"It's really nice 👍👍👍👍\"}]}"
